   102	#      Guarantee: support colors are placed in a 2-vs-1 or 2-vs-0 pattern.
   103	#    - Assumption: the legend's same-color helper is not a real source block.
   104	#      Guarantee: solver explicitly excludes same-color neighbors of legend source
